PROPS: Hospital maintenance workshop (IPSRS) in the morning: metal shelves with labeled spare-part boxes, a workbench with a multimeter and a medical infusion pump opened for service, a wall-mounted red fire extinguisher, a small desk with a laptop and a thin worn folder. Fluorescent light mixed with daylight from a high window. Any other people appear only as a blurred shoulder at frame edge. No readable text anywhere. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · Close-up of a fire extinguisher pressure gauge, then cut to medium shot of the talent at the workbench looking at camera, holding his phone. VO (ID, verbatim): "Direktur tanya soal kalibrasi alat." Delivery (EN): calm but uneasy, slightly lowered voice. 2–4s Problem · Medium shot, he flips through a thin worn folder with a few loose papers. VO (ID, verbatim): "Datanya ada di banyak catatan." Delivery (EN): frustrated, honest. 4–6s Problem · Medium close-up, he glances at the shelves of equipment then back to camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Mana yang lewat, saya belum yakin." Delivery (EN): quiet, worried. 6–8s Problem · He closes the thin folder and sets it down on the bench. VO (ID, verbatim): "Padahal surveior pasti cek labelnya." Delivery (EN): firm, a little anxious. 8–10s Beat · Medium shot, he exhales and rubs the back of his neck, short glance to camera. VO: none. AUDIO: Soft hum of fluorescent lights and a distant hospital corridor. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, re